<?xml version='1.0' encoding='utf-8'?>
<definitions xmlns="http://www.omg.org/spec/BPMN/20100524/MODEL" xmlns:bpmndi="http://www.omg.org/spec/BPMN/20100524/DI" xmlns:dc="http://www.omg.org/spec/DD/20100524/DC" xmlns:di="http://www.omg.org/spec/DD/20100524/DI" id="defs_to_be_02_paket_jadwal" targetNamespace="http://cbt-smk-v2/bpmn/to-be" exporter="CBT SMK v2 Tim To-Be BPMN" exporterVersion="1.0">
  <process id="to_be_02_paket_jadwal" name="To-Be 02 Penyusunan Paket dan Jadwal" isExecutable="false">
    <documentation>To-Be 02 — Penyusunan Paket dan Jadwal DENGAN aplikasi CBT SMK v2.

Alur: Guru memilih bank soal lalu menyusun paket ujian — manual satu per satu
atau acak berstrata dari sistem (mengacu kisi-kisi) — menetapkan durasi dan
KKTP paket. Proktor membuat jadwal ujian, sistem men-generate token ujian.
Token TIDAK ditampilkan di dashboard siswa; diumumkan di ruangan saat sesi.
Bila token digenerate ulang, token lama hangus. Proktor dapat pause jadwal
(timer semua siswa dibekukan) lalu resume (timer lanjut dari sisa waktu).

Asumsi: (1) Paket adalah entitas tersendiri: satu bank bisa dipakai banyak
paket (reguler, remedial, susulan). (2) Acak berstrata memakai strata
kisi-kisi (per baris: indikator + tipe + kesulitan sama). (3) Proktor TIDAK
boleh melihat isi soal, hanya metadata bank. (4) KKTP ditetapkan per
mapel/TP, bukan angka hardcode.

Fakta aplikasi yang dipakai: token kedua membuat token pertama hangus dan
token expiry default 900 detik (KONTRAK §8.6); pause MEMBEKUKAN timer
(KONTRAK §8.6); paket + jadwal + token (KONTRAK §8.4); SoD proktor tidak
lihat isi soal (KONTRAK §5.3); KKTP per mapel/TP (KONTRAK §8.6).</documentation>
    <laneSet id="laneset_to_be_02_paket_jadwal">
      <lane id="lane_0" name="Guru">
        <flowNodeRef>start</flowNodeRef>
        <flowNodeRef>t_pilih</flowNodeRef>
        <flowNodeRef>g_cara</flowNodeRef>
        <flowNodeRef>t_manual</flowNodeRef>
        <flowNodeRef>t_susun</flowNodeRef>
        <flowNodeRef>t_durasi</flowNodeRef>
      </lane>
      <lane id="lane_1" name="Proktor">
        <flowNodeRef>t_jadwal</flowNodeRef>
        <flowNodeRef>g_ulang</flowNodeRef>
        <flowNodeRef>t_umumkan</flowNodeRef>
        <flowNodeRef>g_pause</flowNodeRef>
        <flowNodeRef>t_pause</flowNodeRef>
        <flowNodeRef>t_resume</flowNodeRef>
        <flowNodeRef>end</flowNodeRef>
      </lane>
      <lane id="lane_2" name="Sistem (CBT SMK v2)">
        <flowNodeRef>t_acak</flowNodeRef>
        <flowNodeRef>t_token</flowNodeRef>
        <flowNodeRef>t_hangus</flowNodeRef>
        <flowNodeRef>t_beku</flowNodeRef>
        <flowNodeRef>t_lanjut</flowNodeRef>
      </lane>
    </laneSet>
    <startEvent id="start" name="Mulai">
      <outgoing>f01</outgoing>
    </startEvent>
    <userTask id="t_pilih" name="Pilih Bank Soal">
      <incoming>f01</incoming>
      <outgoing>f02</outgoing>
    </userTask>
    <exclusiveGateway id="g_cara" name="Cara Pilih Soal?">
      <incoming>f02</incoming>
      <outgoing>f03</outgoing>
      <outgoing>f04</outgoing>
    </exclusiveGateway>
    <userTask id="t_manual" name="Pilih Soal Satu per Satu">
      <incoming>f03</incoming>
      <outgoing>f05</outgoing>
    </userTask>
    <serviceTask id="t_acak" name="Generate Soal Acak Berstrata">
      <incoming>f04</incoming>
      <outgoing>f06</outgoing>
    </serviceTask>
    <userTask id="t_susun" name="Susun Paket Ujian">
      <incoming>f05</incoming>
      <incoming>f06</incoming>
      <outgoing>f07</outgoing>
    </userTask>
    <userTask id="t_durasi" name="Tetapkan Durasi dan KKTP Paket">
      <incoming>f07</incoming>
      <outgoing>f08</outgoing>
    </userTask>
    <userTask id="t_jadwal" name="Buat Jadwal Ujian">
      <incoming>f08</incoming>
      <outgoing>f09</outgoing>
    </userTask>
    <serviceTask id="t_token" name="Generate Token Ujian">
      <incoming>f09</incoming>
      <incoming>f12</incoming>
      <outgoing>f10</outgoing>
    </serviceTask>
    <exclusiveGateway id="g_ulang" name="Generate Ulang Token?">
      <incoming>f10</incoming>
      <outgoing>f11</outgoing>
      <outgoing>f13</outgoing>
    </exclusiveGateway>
    <serviceTask id="t_hangus" name="Hanguskan Token Lama">
      <incoming>f11</incoming>
      <outgoing>f12</outgoing>
    </serviceTask>
    <userTask id="t_umumkan" name="Umumkan Jadwal dan Token di Ruangan">
      <incoming>f13</incoming>
      <outgoing>f14</outgoing>
    </userTask>
    <exclusiveGateway id="g_pause" name="Perlu Jeda Jadwal?">
      <incoming>f14</incoming>
      <outgoing>f15</outgoing>
      <outgoing>f20</outgoing>
    </exclusiveGateway>
    <userTask id="t_pause" name="Pause Jadwal">
      <incoming>f15</incoming>
      <outgoing>f16</outgoing>
    </userTask>
    <serviceTask id="t_beku" name="Bekukan Timer Semua Siswa">
      <incoming>f16</incoming>
      <outgoing>f17</outgoing>
    </serviceTask>
    <userTask id="t_resume" name="Resume Jadwal">
      <incoming>f17</incoming>
      <outgoing>f18</outgoing>
    </userTask>
    <serviceTask id="t_lanjut" name="Lanjutkan Timer dari Sisa Waktu">
      <incoming>f18</incoming>
      <outgoing>f19</outgoing>
    </serviceTask>
    <endEvent id="end" name="Selesai: Jadwal Selesai">
      <incoming>f19</incoming>
      <incoming>f20</incoming>
    </endEvent>
    <sequenceFlow id="f01" sourceRef="start" targetRef="t_pilih" />
    <sequenceFlow id="f02" sourceRef="t_pilih" targetRef="g_cara" />
    <sequenceFlow id="f03" sourceRef="g_cara" targetRef="t_manual" name="Manual" />
    <sequenceFlow id="f04" sourceRef="g_cara" targetRef="t_acak" name="Acak berstrata" />
    <sequenceFlow id="f05" sourceRef="t_manual" targetRef="t_susun" />
